        <mxCell id="notes-content" value="✓ 3-Layer Architecture: Presentation → Business Logic → Data Access&#xa;✓ 3 Frontend Applications: Mobile (React Native), Restaurant (Next.js), Admin (React+Vite)&#xa;✓ Centralized Backend: Appwrite Cloud (Auth, Database, Storage, Functions, Realtime)&#xa;✓ State Management: Zustand 5.0 across all apps&#xa;✓ Real-time: WebSocket subscriptions for orders and drone tracking&#xa;✓ Payment: VNPay webhook → Cloud Function → Database update&#xa;✓ Drone Simulation: Cloud Function (60s loop) → Database → Realtime → Mobile&#xa;✓ 16 Database Collections: users, restaurants, menu_items, orders, drones, etc.&#xa;✓ Security: JWT tokens, API keys, row-level permissions&#xa;✓ Scalability: Serverless functions, CDN assets, database indexing" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=10;spacing=5;" parent="1" vertex="1">
